<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET - INDIA VS S.AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - INDIA VS S.AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the India innings on the second day of the first test between India and South Africa at Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 235 (A.Hudson 80; V.Prasad 5-60) India first innings (overnight two without loss)</p>
